  "description": "MongoDB provider for DotNetBoost.MultiLingual. Translations live in one collection, keyed by\n      (entity name, entity id, property name, language code); translatable properties are unmapped\n      from the entity's own documents and read and written through IMultiLingualManager.\n      There is no change tracker to hook, so application code localizes after a query and saves\n      translations alongside its own writes — see docs/adding-a-provider.md.",
